('super-grok','Super Grok','x','linear-gradient(135deg,#000000,#4b4b4b)','Conversational AI','','Super Grok gives you priority access to xAI''s advanced reasoning model with real-time knowledge from X.','Super Grok delivers fast, witty, real-time answers with higher limits and access to the latest Grok models.','Answers questions with live data, reasons through problems, writes content, and analyzes images.','Power users, researchers, and X users who want real-time AI.',0,0,'','["Priority model access", "Real-time X data", "Higher usage limits", "Image understanding"]'::jsonb,'["Latest Grok model", "Live web & X search", "Image analysis", "Faster responses"]'::jsonb,'["Real-time knowledge", "Generous limits", "Bold, direct answers"]'::jsonb,'["Live research", "Trend analysis", "Content writing", "Brainstorming"]'::jsonb,101,true,'active'),
('microsoft-office-365','Microsoft Office 365','O','linear-gradient(135deg,#d83b01,#e74c3c)','Productivity','','Office 365 bundles Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook and OneDrive with cloud sync and Copilot-ready tools.','Microsoft 365 gives you the full desktop and web apps plus 1TB of OneDrive storage across all devices.','Creates documents, spreadsheets, and presentations with the industry-standard Office apps and cloud storage.','Students, professionals, and businesses who rely on Office daily.',0,0,'','["Full Office apps", "1TB OneDrive storage", "Works on all devices", "Always updated"]'::jsonb,'["Word, Excel, PowerPoint", "Outlook", "1TB cloud storage", "Desktop + web + mobile"]'::jsonb,'["Industry standard", "Cross-device sync", "Regular updates"]'::jsonb,'["Reports & docs", "Spreadsheets", "Presentations", "Email"]'::jsonb,102,true,'active'),
('figma','Figma Professional','F','linear-gradient(135deg,#f24e1e,#a259ff)','Design & Creative','','Figma Professional unlocks unlimited projects, version history, and real-time team collaboration for design.','Figma Professional gives you unlimited files, shared libraries, and advanced prototyping in the browser.','Designs interfaces and prototypes in real time with your team, using shared components and libraries.','Product designers, UI/UX teams, and startups.',0,0,'','["Unlimited projects", "Team libraries", "Version history", "Advanced prototyping"]'::jsonb,'["Unlimited files", "Shared components", "Dev mode", "Prototyping", "Real-time collaboration"]'::jsonb,'["Browser-based", "Real-time collab", "Powerful prototyping"]'::jsonb,'["UI design", "Prototypes", "Design systems", "Team handoff"]'::jsonb,103,true,'active'),
